{"unit_id":"TYEclipse__dsh-netdoctor#card-zh","repo":"TYEclipse/dsh-netdoctor","commit":"0b1de6dae6046400b4fe2d5f41e16fef91141931","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-netdoctor 是面向 DSH agent 的网络诊断工具插件，通过 Cordis 将九个工具注册到现有及新建 agent。它可查询十类 DNS 记录、比较多个公共解析器的结果、检测 ping 与 TCP 端口、检查 TLS 证书、分析 HTTP 状态和重定向耗时、追踪路由，并查询公网 IP 与 WHOIS 注册信息。适合排查域名解析、服务连通、证书期限和请求变慢等问题。需要 Node.js 20 以上；ping 和 traceroute 依赖系统命令，公网 IP 地理信息可选使用外部查询服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:110","src/tools.ts:169","src/ip.ts:55","src/whois.ts:218"]}
{"unit_id":"TYEclipse__dsh-netdoctor#card-en","repo":"TYEclipse/dsh-netdoctor","commit":"0b1de6dae6046400b4fe2d5f41e16fef91141931","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-netdoctor gives DSH agents network checks: DNS records and propagation, ping, TCP ports, TLS certificates, HTTP redirects and timing, traceroute, public IP, and WHOIS. Use it to troubleshoot DNS, connectivity, expiry, or slow requests. Needs Node.js 20; ping and traceroute use system commands.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:110","src/tools.ts:169","src/ip.ts:55","src/whois.ts:218"]}
