{"unit_id":"TYEclipse__dsh-netdoctor#feature-dns","repo":"TYEclipse/dsh-netdoctor","commit":"0b1de6dae6046400b4fe2d5f41e16fef91141931","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-netdoctor 的功能「DNS 查询」：查询 A、AAAA、CNAME、MX、TXT、NS、SOA、SRV、PTR 或 CAA 记录，可指定 IP 地址形式的 nameserver；返回记录内容和 TTL。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/dns.ts:60"]}
